Error [E0118]: The name `wanted` is already taken here
  --> pattern_hole_reuse_val_if.jet:5:20
    |
  5 |     if code == Val(wanted) -> print("wanted")
    |                    ^^^^^^
 Why: Inside one function, each name refers to exactly one thing
 Fix: Pick a different name, or assign to the existing one with `wanted = ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0118
